WEBVTT

NOTE
Guide narration timing (local Kokoro voice). Regenerate after the ElevenLabs take.

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.670
Every industrial site changes by the hour.

2
00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.130
Contractors arrive.

3
00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:06.990
Equipment is isolated.

4
00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.170
Work moves.

5
00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:11.250
Insurance sets conditions under which risk is accepted.

6
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.760
Good teams translate them into permits, briefings and checklists.

7
00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:17.430
But no one can hold a moving site in their head.

8
00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:19.610
On Roof 03, hot work begins.

9
00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:22.090
The certificate and safeguards are in place.

10
00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:24.520
Then a sprinkler zone goes offline.

11
00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.190
Nothing looks different.

12
00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:27.630
Work continues.

13
00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:30.590
The conditions have changed, and nobody sees it.

14
00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:33.150
If something goes wrong, questions begin afterwards:

15
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.490
What was happening?

16
00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:36.120
Which condition applied?

17
00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:37.920
Can you prove what was true?

18
00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:40.750
Today, the gap is often discovered too late.

19
00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.660
What if the decision existed when the risk changed?

20
00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:49.510
<v Worker>I'm welding on Roof 03 until six.

21
00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:55.990
Priora connects the activity to the conditions that matter, verifies the certificate and safeguards, and keeps the record.

22
00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:57.710
Prevention before the work.

23
00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:59.490
Proof as it happens.

24
00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:03.600
When the sprinkler goes offline again, Priora sees it immediately.

25
00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:05.660
The risk owner decides:

26
00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:11.620
change the activity, knowingly retain the exposure, or eventually ask selected carriers to cover it.

27
00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:13.550
Most work remains ordinary.

28
00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:16.430
A few changes become explicit decisions.

29
00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:18.040
Record becomes trust.

30
00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:19.820
Trust enables decisions.

31
00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:21.640
Decisions can carry price.

32
00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:23.890
Price can connect to capacity.

33
00:01:23.990 --> 00:01:24.970
Priora.

34
00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:28.210
Infrastructure for activity-level physical risk.
